-- ============================================================================
-- PD5 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Gas Well Performance, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE DESIGN. Three functions a point check cannot reach.
-- loadingProfile walks the whole traverse and finds the CONTROLLING station.
-- sizeTubingForRate turns "it is loading" into a workover. screenPlungerLift
-- turns it into a lift installation. The tier exists because the Associate
-- tier's own answer, computed correctly at the wellhead, is the wrong verdict
-- about the well.
--
-- THE TIER IS BUILT ON ONE SENTENCE: A WELL CAN PASS AT THE GAUGE AND LOAD AT
-- THE SHOE. On the capstone well the wellhead ratio is 1.2552 and the shoe
-- ratio is 0.9253, a margin of -7.474 percent, and the profile crosses one
-- between 4,210 ft and 6,315 ft. Liquid is falling back over the bottom third
-- of the string while every surface number says the well is healthy. The
-- reason is that the two quantities move in OPPOSITE directions with depth:
-- the critical rate RISES as the gas gets denser and the actual velocity FALLS
-- as the same standard rate occupies less volume. The margin therefore closes
-- downward on every gas well, and the only question is whether it closes
-- before the shoe.
--
-- WHAT THE TIER MUST NOT OVERSTATE, and it is handed straight to the tier
-- above. The correlation this design runs on was chosen ONCE, from the
-- WELLHEAD pressure, by a rule with a 1000 psia threshold that the capstone
-- wellhead sits 0.38 psi below. It is then applied at the shoe, which is at
-- 2.26 times that threshold. The design in this tier is correct given its
-- correlation and the correlation is a judgement made at the wrong station.
-- Teaching the switch as a threshold and stopping there is the error; the
-- point is that the threshold is READ at a station that is not the one the
-- answer is USED at.
--
-- A SCREEN WHOSE TWO HALVES DISAGREE, AND THE ENGINE SURFACES IT RATHER THAN
-- RESOLVING IT. The plunger fallback on this well returns pressureOk TRUE and
-- glrOk FALSE, and `ruleOfThumbAgrees` comes back false because the 400
-- scf/bbl per 1000 ft heuristic asks for 3,368 scf/bbl, which the well beats
-- twice over, while the force balance asks 2.763 times that, which it misses.
-- A report that quotes the half that passes has hidden the answer. Two tests
-- of one installation disagreeing is information, and a function that returned
-- a single verdict here would have destroyed it.
--
-- The only numbers that travel to the tier above are the well's own stated
-- conditions and the candidate list. The tier above restates all of them.
-- ============================================================================

values ('gaswell', 'intermediate', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-a-well-is-not-a-station","title":"A Well Is Not a Station","lesson_keys":["l01-the-traverse","l02-the-profile-down-the-hole","l03-where-loading-starts","l04-the-controlling-station","l05-what-a-profile-refuses"]},{"key":"m02-reading-a-loaded-well","title":"Reading a Loaded Well","lesson_keys":["l01-the-margin","l02-the-loaded-flag","l03-where-the-crossing-sits","l04-what-a-verdict-costs"]},{"key":"m03-sizing-the-tubing","title":"Sizing the Tubing","lesson_keys":["l01-a-velocity-string","l02-candidates-and-the-pick","l03-what-the-sizing-optimises","l04-the-station-the-sizing-was-given","l05-what-sizing-cannot-fix"]},{"key":"m04-the-plunger","title":"The Plunger","lesson_keys":["l01-what-a-plunger-does","l02-the-lift-pressure","l03-the-gas-requirement","l04-the-screen-and-its-verdict","l05-what-the-screen-does-not-check"]},{"key":"m05-choosing-a-remedy","title":"Choosing a Remedy","lesson_keys":["l01-four-remedies-one-problem","l02-what-each-one-buys","l03-what-each-one-costs","l04-what-the-engine-will-not-choose"]},{"key":"m06-the-professional-reading","title":"The Professional Reading","lesson_keys":["l01-the-story-so-far","l02-working-the-capstone","l03-onward"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
on conflict (app_slug, tier) do update
  set structure = excluded.structure,
      content_version = excluded.content_version,
      active = true,
      updated_at = now();

delete from public.academy_quiz_questions
 where app_slug = 'gaswell' and tier = 'intermediate';

